OL,3,GNEWSA'Gargantuan' turbines could be
OL,4,Abuilt on farmland
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn onshore wind farm, which would see
OL,7,Fup to 32 turbines built on agricultural
OL,8,Fland, has been criticised by
OL,9,Fpoliticians.
OL,11,FThe proposals for Redmere Wind Farm
OL,12,Fcome from Swedish company Vattenfall
OL,13,Fand would see the turbines, which are
OL,14,Fup to 721ft (220m) tall, built on land
OL,15,Fcovering the Cambridgeshire, Norfolk
OL,16,Fand Suffolk borders.
OL,18,FTristan Gale, Suffolk County Council's
OL,19,Fcabinet member for planning called the
OL,20,Fproposals "unprecedented in scale"
OL,21,Fadding the turbines "would be
OL,22,Fgargantuan and seen from miles around."
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
