OL,3,GNEWSA'Gargantuan' turbines could be
OL,4,Abuilt on farmland
OL,5,
OL,6,FVattenfall, owned by the Swedish state,
OL,7,Fsaid: "Redmere wind farm could make a
OL,8,Fmajor contribution to cleaner, more
OL,9,Fsecure energy systems while bringing
OL,10,Fjobs and investment to the local area."
